     "body": "internal/gateway/handover_test.go. Failed in 0.02s on ubuntu-latest, run 40166079788 (head 1b039a3c7, a GUI-only change, so it's in the base). Not red at b5a78fd8b's run. Probably related to #3451 (TestRestartHandsTheGatewayOver, also red on macOS in this run). Not taken by me.",
